      "normalized_sha256": "f5c7b761ec71892275f909c07e8f29124daca7a634e74c5709cda21666d9b165",
      "rationale": "This is the base equation of the newly declared total structural predicate allIntVS, defining the empty ValSeq case as true.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-f5c7b761ec71892275f909c07e8f29124daca7a634e74c5709cda21666d9b165",
      "start_line": 8,
      "text": "  rule allIntVS(.ValSeq) => true"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 10,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "581f4df071fdd7d974c5141cf36a1e876f38b798cc51952636578533c09a0f8a",
      "rationale": "This is the recursive equation defining allIntVS on vCons by testing the head with isInt and recursively processing the strictly smaller tail.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-581f4df071fdd7d974c5141cf36a1e876f38b798cc51952636578533c09a0f8a",
      "start_line": 9,
      "text": "  rule allIntVS(vCons(V:Val, VS:ValSeq))\n    => isInt(V) andBool allIntVS(VS)"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 17,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "7a08aa58034b9a659c1e60660998e0b301a0f3e3408204cc84b658c58946b4d0",
      "rationale": "This guarded equation defines the nonnegative branch of the newly declared summary popcountAbs using the fixed-semantics binCodes and cntSub functions.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-7a08aa58034b9a659c1e60660998e0b301a0f3e3408204cc84b658c58946b4d0",
      "start_line": 15,
      "text": "  rule popcountAbs(I:Int)\n    => cntSub(binCodes(I), iCons(49, .IntSeq))\n    requires I >=Int 0"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 20,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "caabcce04b85453cd68f8e2e64ab67393a09fdfcffd4cf6a5de838b958201752",
      "rationale": "This guarded equation defines the negative branch of popcountAbs by applying the same fixed-semantics summaries to the magnitude 0 -Int I.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-caabcce04b85453cd68f8e2e64ab67393a09fdfcffd4cf6a5de838b958201752",
      "start_line": 18,
      "text": "  rule popcountAbs(I:Int)\n    => cntSub(binCodes(0 -Int I), iCons(49, .IntSeq))\n    requires I <Int 0"
    }
  ],
